{"title":"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two numbers have a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. If one of the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/e/c2efdc1c5dc423301f074f080b4a5935fb7a2f15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$–36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, what is the other number?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/1/2f1dd5a9fcbf006501f451b00a11ce8c65c34097.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 68 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ -4 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 72 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ -68$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"402\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The other number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/9/1c94caf5db015d365e20c1d69daec78d7fb30048.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32 - (-36) = \\boxed{68},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"144\" height=\"23\" /> so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/8/0b896059aa1ec9c87c9c65958d9a4c11bfc6ff48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"29\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>-edited by coolmath34\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index